e and more powerful until you become a gun God! </li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481610/extras/40a287c391d98446a5f71e6a08e2379d.poster.avif?t=1703108610\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481610/extras/40a287c391d98446a5f71e6a08e2379d.webm?t=1703108610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481610/extras/40a287c391d98446a5f71e6a08e2379d.mp4?t=1703108610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
